{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>A tenth of an ephah.</b> The ephah is three se'ah; the se'ah is six kav; the kav is four log; the log is six eggs — so a tenth of an ephah comes to forty-three eggs and a fifth of an egg, and that is the measure for the challah-offering and for the meal-offerings."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:48.890374462Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}